          ["n(N2O4) = 0.60, n(NO2) = 0.80, total = 1.40.", "p(N2O4) = 0.60/1.40 x 100 = 42.86 kPa; p(NO2) = 0.80/1.40 x 100 = 57.14 kPa.", "Kp = 57.14^2 / 42.86 = 76.2 kPa."], 0.3, "kPa",
